*** Keywords ***
DL_Test_Model_TDD_Start_and_Stop_for_multiple_cells
    [Documentation]
    ...  Downlink Test Model Verification for multiple cells. Particulatr Test Model is performing for all
    ...  commissioned cells at the same time. Version for TDD radios differs from other versions by nrarfcn argument.
    ...  Mandatory parameters: - test_model (str): type of Downlink Test model, e.g. "NR-FR1-TM1.1"
    ...  Optional parameters:  - cell_ids (list[int]): list of cell ids to perform test model, e.g. [0, 1]
    ...                          Default None value means test model will be performed on all configurated cells.
    ...                        - power_backoff (int): parameter required to start test model, default set on 0
    ...                        - beam_id (int): parameter required to start test model, default set on 1
    ...                        - polarization  (str): parameter required to start test model, default set on "P_both"
    ...                        - download_dir  (str): absolute path to download temporary scf file, default set on "/tmp"
    ...                        - star_time_sleep (int): sleep time (in seconds) after each test model startup,
    ...                          default set on 30
    ...                        - timeout (int): timeout (in seconds) for test model start and stop, default set on 25

    [Arguments]                                             ${test_model}
    ...                                                     ${cell_ids}=${None}
    ...                                                     ${power_backoff}=0
    ...                                                     ${beam_id}=1
    ...                                                     ${polarization}=P_both
    ...                                                     ${download_dir}=/tmp
    ...                                                     ${star_time_sleep}=30s
    ...                                                     ${timeout}=25
    [Timeout]                                               4 hour
    Create admin session with default alias
    ${connection}                                           connections.get_default_admin_connection_alias
    ${webui_obj}                                            Create Selenium Session
    ...                                                     admin_connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     download_dir=${logs_path}

    @{test_cell_ids}=              run keyword if          '${cell_ids}' == '${None}'
    ...                                                     Get NR Cells Ids
    ...                                                     download_dir=${download_dir}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ...                            ELSE                     set variable
    ...                                                     ${cell_ids}

    Remove All Test Modules Result Files

    ${cell_parameters}                                      Get Required Parameters of All Cells Needed to Test Module Activation
    ...                                                     cells_ids=@{test_cell_ids}
    ...                                                     download_dir=${download_dir}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}

    FOR    ${tm_index}  ${test_cell_id}  IN ENUMERATE      @{test_cell_ids}
        ${test_id}=         Evaluate                        ${tm_index} + 1
        ${local_cell}=      Set variable                    ${cell_parameters["${test_cell_id}"]["local_cell_name"]}
        ${nrarfcn}=         Set variable                    ${cell_parameters["${test_cell_id}"]["cell_nrarfcn"]}
        ${test_pmax}=       Set variable                    ${cell_parameters["${test_cell_id}"]["cell_pmax"]}
        Start Downlink Test                                 test_id=${test_id}
        ...                                                 test_model=${test_model}
        ...                                                 local_cell=${local_cell}
        ...                                                 p_max=${test_pmax}
        ...                                                 polarization=${polarization}
        ...                                                 beam_id=${beam_id}
        ...                                                 power_backoff=${power_backoff}
        ...                                                 nrarfcn=${nrarfcn}
        ...                                                 timeout=${timeout}
        sleep                                               ${star_time_sleep}  reason=Test Module performing...
    END

    FOR    ${tm_index}  ${test_cell_id}  IN ENUMERATE      @{test_cell_ids}
        ${test_id}=                           Evaluate       ${tm_index} + 1
        ${local_cell}=                        Set variable   ${cell_parameters["${test_cell_id}"]["local_cell_name"]}
        Stop Downlink Test Module                            test_id=${test_id}
        Robot Log Result                                     Test model for cell ${local_cell} has stopped.
    END

    [Teardown]                                              Downlink Test Activation Teardown
